<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-099-B habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.434448" lon="-120.96542"><name>SC26-099-B</name><cmt>SC26-099</cmt><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 6.3 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 60/100; not catch probability. Center 72 ft; nearby 71–89 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Near a source-coverage edge; checked 100 m circle is complete. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-079</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.43757242209805" lon="-120.96627757430056"/><trkpt lat="35.43687935255376" lon="-120.96794730449417"/><trkpt lat="35.43210346610582" lon="-120.96806734167414"/><trkpt lat="35.431546114693376" lon="-120.96709003726198"/><trkpt lat="35.43134919979977" lon="-120.96610367977014"/><trkpt lat="35.430551184276204" lon="-120.96689476320353"/><trkpt lat="35.42983585847759" lon="-120.96724317909892"/><trkpt lat="35.42929519189991" lon="-120.9672567708061"/><trkpt lat="35.42928962926855" lon="-120.96692648289445"/><trkpt lat="35.42883907383868" lon="-120.96693781087784"/><trkpt lat="35.42884463637799" lon="-120.96726809695225"/><trkpt lat="35.42830396970305" lon="-120.96728168799588"/><trkpt lat="35.42748555303974" lon="-120.96686169981875"/><trkpt lat="35.42766392